{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1297666-high-end-technocrat-what-does-it-look-like","id":1297666,"title":"High end technocrat - what does it look like?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-18T02:22:49-07:00","id":1297666,"title":"High end technocrat - what does it look like?","content":"So yeah, I've seen examples of high end arch mages. Rocks that are impossible to lift and yet they can lift it. Timeline manipulation and destruction. Seeing the future. And lots more.<br /> <br /> What else can a high end technocracy do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-18T03:40:52-07:00","id":1297679,"title":"","content":"Hmh. Let's see...<br /> <br /> Iteration X<br /> --------------<br /> Whenever I think of a high-end ItXer, I think of <b>Metal Gear Rising's Raiden</b>, and of course <b>Tony Stark</b>.<br /> Examples of a (very) high end cyborg in Raiden's case ( Just watch a few clips of MgR: Revengeance and enjoy the insanity...), and Stark's more artisan-inclined ItXer who just breaks conventional physics on several levels on his own, because he can. Er, because technology can. He's just SO GOOD at it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: And of course someone like <b>Motoko Kusanagi/The Major</b> - also a high end cyborg - but while being capable of superhuman physical feats, is more enlightened in her mental capabilities, being able to understand and manipulate data in ways and at speeds that make her essentially demigod-like in that regard. She is rocking Data 5 - at least. If you use one of the two systems of Archspheres, she has Data 6 or higher, depending on the GitS source material (Anime movies, Mangas, Stand Alone Complex series, Arise series...) you want to use. It makes her almost alien in a couple of them, more grounded in others - but even in the latter case, you sometimes get the vibe that she is close to a sort of second awakening. She would be ItX's actual Dante - especially due to her having been a cyborg since a young age.<br /> <br /> Progenitors<br /> ----------------<br /> I can't think of something that *really* fits off the top of my head, but Progenitor-like characters like <b>Poison Ivy</b> (with some leeway), certain baddie masterminds of the <b>Resident Evil</b> series (without implying the Progenitors are bad, we're just going off abilities here..), and other experts at downright unreal medicine, genetic manipulation and biology. I am sure there are some characters that are absolutely over-the-top that would fit the bill, but I just can't think of anyone specific right now.<br /> <br /> Syndicate &amp; The NWO<br /> ---------------------------------<br /> This one is...tough! Due to the fact that both groups prefer subtle magics all around, it's hard to pinpoint good character examples, but if you want to a general concept of a high-end Syndicate member, just look in the direction of conspiracies. The <b>Illuminati</b> and other groups that control the economy (and indeed the world) at a whim through godlike influence, intimidation, financial power and seemingly having their fingers in everything. Now that I think about it, <b>David Xanatos</b> from Gargoyles might very well be a high Arete Syndicate member. There is a reason he has a <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/XanatosGambit\" target=\"_blank\">trope named after him</a>. Actually, <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/XanatosSpeedchess\" target=\"_blank\">Several of them</a>.<br /> <br /> Now, the NWO has a strange example I can think of. It's not literally an NWO-like character, but if you've seen the movie '<b>Upgrade</b>', the whole fighting style the main character displays is definitely something a high-end White Suit would pull off - combined with downright paradoxical applications of unrealistic damage. Add a splash of super-human moves and senses of the <b>Agents from the Matrix</b>, along with impromptu gadget-tinkering from <b>MiB</b>, and psychological control along <b>Dark City</b>, all wrapped into a single person. Scary. <i>Really scary</i>.<br /> <br /> Void Engineers<br /> ----------------------<br /> Hummh. Admittedly? I have no idea. The child of a W40k SPESS MEHREEN and MacGyver. In spaaaaaaaace!<br /> <br /> <br /> .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 03-18-2019, 10:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-19T05:46:48-07:00","id":1297936,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna disagree here. Iron Man and Motoko Kusanagi are around mid level Iterators. Not archscientists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-19T05:52:57-07:00","id":1297937,"title":"","content":"I actually overlooked the absolute high-end &quot;Arch&quot; requirement. I can't actually think of a character that meets the criteria of an actual endgame, high-archspheres Archmage Technocrat.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-19T06:09:09-07:00","id":1297939,"title":"","content":"Personally, It would look like precursor tech in space opera series to me. Like, you would have handheld devices with a subdimension inside containing all the crazy workings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-19T12:06:04-07:00","id":1298019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1297666-high-end-technocrat-what-does-it-look-like?p=1297936#post1297936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm gonna disagree here. Iron Man and Motoko Kusanagi are around mid level Iterators. Not archscientists.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, Tony clearly has Matter 5 considering what he does in IM2, so he's definitely Master-level. Just not Archmaster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-19T12:21:06-07:00","id":1298021,"title":"","content":"I also still say that certain incarnations of Motoko have Data 6+. Not the time(s) where she works for Section 9, but the timeline(s) after that.<br /> <br /> In a way, imagining mystic Archmasters is easier because we have media full of super powerful wizards, once-human demigods and creatures along those lines. For actual Technocrats, it's...hard, because we simply have not much in terms of inspiring material. Just like the Syndicate probably has the most exotic paradigm, actual archmaster Technocrats are more alien to imagine than enhlightened mystic half-gods.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-19T13:36:09-07:00","id":1298029,"title":"","content":"How about Xelee or The Culture?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-19T14:16:42-07:00","id":1298039,"title":"","content":"To me, a character at this level can do things like:<br /> -Create large scale changes in subconscious feelings towards things<br /> -Exhibit almost arbitrary technopathy<br /> -Detect cosmic phenomenon through how they affect flow of forces far subtler than mortal science (detect hawking radiation)<br /> -Dispel quantum randomness - Generate systems that function perfectly without flaw even when intruded on by outside forces (meissner effect something something)<br /> -Create next level meta materials like room temperature semi conductors or room temperature stable ice<br /> -Thumb through the collective consciousness/zeitgeist to find a piece of information known by anyone<br /> -Leverage non-locality of spacetime to move resources between non-comoving spaces or treat areas like closed spacelike (not timelike) curves.<br /> -Codify seemingly random universal phenomena into forces","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T15:59:55-07:00","id":1383460,"title":"","content":"ItX - the movie Lucy (w/ Scarlet Johannsen)<br /> VE - Q from Star Trek?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26116-realitymasque","name":"RealityMasque","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T19:07:55-07:00","id":1383496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RealityMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1297666-high-end-technocrat-what-does-it-look-like?p=1383460#post1383460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ItX - the movie Lucy (w/ Scarlet Johannsen)<br /> VE - Q from Star Trek?</div> </div> </div> </div>Iteration X? <br /> <br /> Isn't Lucy a high level psychic that basically turned into an energy being?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-25T23:07:30-07:00","id":1383915,"title":"","content":"Lucy would be a progenitor, one of their factions is all about gaining power through drug regimens.<br /> <br /> I think a example of a high level NWO agent would be the psi cops from Babylon 5.<br /> <br /> And for the VE, the Spartans from Halo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","name":"rickayelm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T02:59:01-07:00","id":1383926,"title":"","content":"Hmmm. A Sentai team composed of: The digitized human intelligence answer to Neil Gaiman's Mr. World manifested as a construct made purely of energy; the secret president of media organizations and secret services of the world; the amazing shape shifting multi-bodied indestructible clone woman; quintillioniaire Bill Elon Jones; and cyborg Stephen Hawking in a warhammer 40k Dreadnaught; all in command of Dimensional Starship CERN","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12480,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","user":"Spacecat","date":". 04-26-2020, 07:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T13:25:51-07:00","id":1384489,"title":"","content":"At the very top the Technocracy is Control (with capital C). The disembodied notion of control and tyranny itself (check Mage: Ascension), the technocracy &quot;archmasters&quot; have turned ito that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}